{"audio": "1corinthians-08.opus", "duration_ms": 112609, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3960, "text": "1 Corinthians, Chapter Eight."}, {"start_ms": 5340, "end_ms": 10561, "text": "Now about food sacrificed to idols: We know that we all have knowledge."}, {"start_ms": 11241, "end_ms": 14141, "text": "Knowledge puffs up, but love builds up."}, {"start_ms": 15081, "end_ms": 19142, "text": "The one who thinks he knows something does not yet know as he ought to know."}, {"start_ms": 19822, "end_ms": 22622, "text": "But the one who loves God is known by God."}, {"start_ms": 23402, "end_ms": 31843, "text": "So about eating food sacrificed to idols: We know that an idol is nothing at all in the world, and that there is no God but one."}, {"start_ms": 32543, "end_ms": 47284, "text": "For even if there are so-called gods, whether in heaven or on earth (as there are many so-called gods and lords), yet for us there is but one God, the Father, from whom all things came and for whom we exist."}, {"start_ms": 47904, "end_ms": 53664, "text": "And there is but one Lord, Jesus Christ, through whom all things came and through whom we exist."}, {"start_ms": 54644, "end_ms": 56645, "text": "But not everyone has this knowledge."}, {"start_ms": 57285, "end_ms": 63765, "text": "Some people are still so accustomed to idols that they eat such food as if it were sacrificed to an idol."}, {"start_ms": 64505, "end_ms": 67505, "text": "And since their conscience is weak, it is defiled."}, {"start_ms": 68365, "end_ms": 74646, "text": "But food does not bring us closer to God: We are no worse if we do not eat, and no better if we do."}, {"start_ms": 75446, "end_ms": 79706, "text": "Be careful, however, that your freedom does not become a stumbling block to the weak."}, {"start_ms": 80386, "end_ms": 90067, "text": "For if someone with a weak conscience sees you who are well informed eating in an idol’s temple, will he not be encouraged to eat food sacrificed to idols?"}, {"start_ms": 90967, "end_ms": 95908, "text": "So this weak brother, for whom Christ died, is destroyed by your knowledge."}, {"start_ms": 96468, "end_ms": 102568, "text": "By sinning against your brothers in this way and wounding their weak conscience, you sin against Christ."}, {"start_ms": 103428, "end_ms": 110849, "text": "Therefore, if what I eat causes my brother to stumble, I will never eat meat again, so that I will not cause him to stumble."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 2380, "si": 0}, {"t": "Corinthians,", "s": 2380, "e": 3220, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 3220, "e": 3580, "si": 0}, {"t": "Eight.", "s": 3740, "e": 3960, "si": 0}, {"t": "Now", "s": 5340, "e": 5540, "si": 1}, {"t": "about", "s": 5700, "e": 5980, "si": 1}, {"t": "food", "s": 6080, "e": 6361, "si": 1}, {"t": "sacrificed", "s": 6521, "e": 7181, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 7201, "e": 7261, "si": 1}, {"t": "idols:", "s": 7461, "e": 7841, "si": 1}, {"t": "We", "s": 8141, "e": 8221, "si": 1}, {"t": "know", "s": 8301, "e": 8561, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 8861, "e": 9021, "si": 1}, {"t": "we", "s": 9101, "e": 9181, "si": 1}, {"t": "all", "s": 9381, "e": 9541, "si": 1}, {"t": "have", "s": 9641, "e": 9901, "si": 1}, {"t": "knowledge.", "s": 9981, "e": 10561, "si": 1}, {"t": "Knowledge", "s": 11241, "e": 11741, "si": 2}, {"t": "puffs", "s": 11861, "e": 12121, "si": 2}, {"t": "up,", "s": 12201, "e": 12321, "si": 2}, {"t": "but", "s": 12681, "e": 12821, "si": 2}, {"t": "love", "s": 12981, "e": 13341, "si": 2}, {"t": "builds", "s": 13561, "e": 13941, "si": 2}, {"t": "up.", "s": 14021, "e": 14141, "si": 2}, {"t": "The", "s": 15081, "e": 15161, "si": 3}, {"t": "one", "s": 15281, "e": 15461, "si": 3}, {"t": "who", "s": 15521, "e": 15621, "si": 3}, {"t": "thinks", "s": 15761, "e": 16061, "si": 3}, {"t": "he", "s": 16101, "e": 16161, "si": 3}, {"t": "knows", "s": 16261, "e": 16581, "si": 3}, {"t": "something", "s": 16661, "e": 17101, "si": 3}, {"t": "does", "s": 17241, "e": 17441, "si": 3}, {"t": "not", "s": 17541, 